# LLM-Based User Profile System Design Document

## Executive Summary

This document specifies a 5-layer user profile system that infers user interests and preferences from Edge browser signals, using LLM-based summarization to generate rich, structured profiles. The system prioritizes read latency (<5ms P99), privacy (no raw data retention), and eventual consistency for writes.

---

## 1. Full Profile Schema

### 1.1 Layer 1: Identity (Monthly)

**Purpose:** Stable, long-lived attributes that change infrequently. Inferred once and updated only on explicit signal shift or monthly regeneration.

